        "Content": "Due to the high level of interest in this property, please do not call.\r\n\r\nHenry Wiltshire Estate Agents are delighted to present Apartment 16, Scariff House to the rental market.\r\n\r\nThis spacious two-bedroom apartment offers well-proportioned accommodation, including a master bedroom with ensuite, a bright open-plan living, kitchen and dining area, and a large private balcony.\r\n\r\nThe property also benefits from one designated parking space.\r\n\r\nLocated in the highly sought-after area of Waterville, Blanchardstown, Dublin 15, the apartment is ideally positioned close to a wide range of local amenities, transport links and services.\r\n\r\nAccommodation includes:\r\n\r\nTwo spacious bedrooms\r\n\r\nMaster bedroom with ensuite\r\n\r\nOpen-plan living, kitchen and dining area\r\n\r\nLarge balcony\r\n\r\nOne designated parking space\r\n\r\nSought-after Waterville, Blanchardstown, Dublin 15 location\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended due to the strong level of interest."
